--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/7432.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Skipped tests marked with ``pytest.mark.skip``/``skipif`` now report the
+location of the test itself instead of the location within ``_pytest/skipping.py``
+when ``--runxfail`` is also given.
